# Phase 6: Production Hardening, Azure Container Apps & Day-2 Operations

## Overview
Phase 6 packages, hardens, and operationalizes Ulavan Connect for production deployment on Azure Container Apps (ACA). This includes declarative Bicep/YAML deployment templates with Zero-Trust Managed Identity bindings and Key Vault secret references, Application Insights distributed tracing with automated PII redaction, operator replay tooling, scheduled retention cleanup jobs, and comprehensive operational runbooks.

---

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The API Gateway (`uzhavan-gateway`) enforces `minReplicas: 1` to strictly eliminate cold-start webhook latency (< 500ms response SLA). All containers enforce `readOnlyRootFilesystem: true` to guarantee zero local disk writes.

