## Proposed Changes

### 1. Distributed Telemetry & PII Redaction
#### [NEW] [`src/platform/telemetry/masking.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/platform/telemetry/masking.py)
- `mask_phone_number`: Redacts sensitive phone digits (`+919876543210` $\rightarrow$ `+91XXXXXX3210`).
- `mask_sensitive_dict`: Recursively masks tokens, credentials, phone fields, and converts binary buffers to byte summaries.
- `PIIMaskingFilter`: Custom logging filter intercepting log records and redacting PII before streaming.

#### [NEW] [`src/platform/telemetry/tracer.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/platform/telemetry/tracer.py)
- Contextual tracer propagating `correlation_id`, `message_id`, and `provider_message_id`.

